/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:5:> 提取的原语：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:6:> - 操作类：填充/fill, 洪泛填充/flood_fill, 镜像/reflect/mirror, 颜色序列反转/reverse_color_seq, 连线/line_drawing, 裁剪/crop, 循环位移/cyclic_roll, 重涂色/recolor, 擦除/erase, 补全/reconstruct, 计数/counting, 选择/selection, 模板匹配/template_matching, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 移动/move, 压缩/downscale, 逻辑运算/logical_operation, 反转/invert, 生长/grow
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:7:> - 对象类：种子像素/seed_pixel, 封闭腔体/enclosed_cavity, 线条画/line_drawing, 画布/canvas, 单像素宽路径/one_pixel_path, 端点像素/endpoint_pixel, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 正交路径/orthogonal_path, 控制行/control_row, 控制列/control_column, 多色对象/multicolor_obj, 侧边标记/side_marker, 面板区域/panel_region, 边框竖条/frame_bar, 端点标记/endpoint_marker, 字形模板/glyph_template, 矩形框/rectangular_frame, 内部区域/interior_region, 空心矩形/hollow_rect, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 矩形/rectangle, 横分隔线/divider, 标记掩码/marker_mask, 目录模板/catalog_template, 工作区精灵/workspace_sprite, 目录区域/catalog_region, 边框/frame, 矩形分区/rectangular_partition, 前景对象/foreground_object, 分隔列/separator_column, 等宽面板/equal_width_panel, 掩码/mask, 杯状轮廓/cup_outline, 种子行/seed_row, 稀疏标记线/sparse_marker_line, 前景图案/foreground_motif
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:8:> - 空间关系类：连通可达/connectivity_reachable, 纵向拼接/vertical_stacking, 端到端遍历/endpoint_traversal, 经由中间点路由/routed_via_waypoint, 双轴偏移编码/dual_axis_offset, 包含于/contained_in, 颜色对应形状/color_to_shape, 边框包围内容/border_encloses_content, 包含/containment, 对角配对/diagonal_pairing, 两区域比较/region_comparison, 子精灵对齐/sub_sprite_align, 颜色匹配边/color_matches_side, 网格采样/grid_sampling, 邻接/adjacency, 逐格比较/cell_comparison, 相邻间隔/adjacent_gap, 平行对称轴/parallel_axes
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:9:> - 条件类：种子色标记填充/seed_color_labels_fill, 对称翻转追加/symmetric_appending_reversed_rows, 形状不变仅反色序/shape_fixed_reversed, 先横后纵路由/horizontal_then_vertical, 标记位定位移量/marker_is_shift, 接触侧定色/contact_side_color, 锚点定位/anchor_position, 最大面积选取/largest_area_selection, 完整边框检测/complete_border_check, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 面积奇偶定填充色/parity_sets_fill, 同色对定义矩形/pair_defines_rect, 最大增长差/maximum_growth_difference, 部分匹配识别/partial_match_id, 颜色决定目标边/color_determines_side, 每分区缩为单像素/each_partition_reduced_to_one_pixel, 标记侧翻转且变色/mirror_toward_marker_recolor, 双空交集涂色/intersect_empty_fill, 配对色映射/paired_color_mapping, 标记色决定填充/marker_color_sets_fill, 追加封盖层/cap_layer_added, 交替变色/alternating_color, 间隔行生成/gap_row_generate, 跨标记线反射/reflect_across_markers
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:10:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/006.md:11:> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。
