/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:6:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:7:> - 操作类：连线(connect), 重涂色(recolor), 压缩(compress), 排序(sorting), 同心层填充(concentric_fill), 射线延伸(ray_extend), 填充(fill), 平移(translate), 擦除(erase), 镜像(mirror), 平铺(tiling), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 拼接(concatenate), 滑动(sliding), 旋转(rotate), 颜色互换(color_swap), 对接拼合(docking), 裁剪(crop), 洪泛填充(flood_fill)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:8:> - 对象类：标记像素(marker_pixel), 线段(line_segment), 竖直条(vertical_bar), 粗粒度块(coarse_block), 十字分隔线(cross_separator), 四象限(quadrant), 同心正方形层(concentric_layer), 碎片帧(fragmented_frame), 叶状突起(leaf_protrusion), 双色矩形(bicolor_rectangle), 连通腔室(connected_chamber), 分隔墙(separator_wall), 对角射线种子(diagonal_ray_seed), 反射镜段(mirror_segment), 多色精灵体(multicolor_sprite), 嵌入标记像素(embedded_marker), 孤立控制点(isolated_control), 瓦片(tile), 精灵体(sprite), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel), 单像素宽条(thin_bar), 前景对象(foreground_object), 连接点(connector_pixel), 分隔线(divider_line), 通道(lane), 迷宫走廊(maze_corridor), 种子像素(seed_pixel), 多色连通分量(multicolor_component), 矩形边框(rectangular_frame), 图例(legend), 数据区象限(data_quadrant)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:9:> - 空间关系类：同行列对齐(row_col_aligned), 等分(equal_split), 阵列排布(array_layout), 主色代表区域(dominant_per_region), 嵌套层次(nesting_hierarchy), 突起定行列(leaf_selects_row_col), 正交邻接(orthogonal_adjacency), 边界反射(boundary_reflection), 颜色配对(color_pairing), 象限排布(quadrant_layout), 中心对齐(center_alignment), 行列对齐(row_column_alignment), 中心点不变(center_fixed), 对象内双色配对(bicolor_pairing_within_object), 对接对齐(docking_alignment), 分隔线两侧(opposite_sides_of_divider), 路径连通(path_connectivity), 形状频次分组(shape_frequency_grouping), 框内区域(interior_region)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:10:> - 条件/判断类：首尾跨度填充(span_fill_between), 下半变色(lower_half_recolored), 含标记涂标记色(marker_presence_color), 去噪取主色(denoise_majority), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 按边长降序排列(descending_side_order), 内外色互换延伸(swap_extend), 邻接多数决(adjacent_majority_vote), 特定色反射射线(specific_reflects), 锚点对齐目标(anchor_aligns), 双轴反射(biaxial_reflection), 角落补全四重对称(corners_to_fourfold_symmetry), 压缩到标记旁(compress_to_adjacent_marker), 象限对应图例颜色(quadrant_mapped_by_legend), 朝向交换长度保持(orient_swap_keep), 同对象内互换(swap_within_same_object), 连接点颜色匹配(connector_color_match), 压缩至远端边界(pack_to_far_edge), 路径奇偶交替涂色(alternating_color_by_path_parity), 旋转翻转不变(rotation_flip_invariant), 共享与唯一形状(shared_vs_unique_shape), 框内限定(frame_interior_only)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/11/036.md:11:>
